  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you cast any level 1+ spell from your Psionic Spells feature, you can cast it by expending a spell slot as normal or by spending a number of Sorcery Points equal to the spell's level. If you cast the spell with Sorcery Points, it requires no Verbal or Somatic components, and it requires no Material components unless they are consumed by the spell or have a cost specified in it.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-BEQuKgrMBr1dqcIm\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Spend as many Sorcery Points as the spell's level (scale the use), then cast the spell without consuming a slot.</p></section>",
